#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Die Redfish-sjablone is nie volledig geïnstalleer nie. Herinstalleer dit vanaf die Redfish-BMC's-bladsy."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "'n Toestel \"%s\" vanaf die %s-toestelsjabloon, deur poller %d gepeil, met beskikbaarheidskontroles af. Sy gasheernaam is 'n gereserveerde naam wat nooit gekontak word nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Die datanavraag \"%s\", met 'n grafiek vir elkeen van die %d lede wat tans bekend is."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d waaiers of kragbronne wat teenwoordig was, word nie meer gerapporteer nie. Hulle tel as misluk totdat jy bevestig; bevestiging aanvaar die lede wat die BMC nou rapporteer."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Die grafiek \"%s\", met sy \"%s\"-databron."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Die BMC is reeds aan 'n toestel gekoppel."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Geskep deur die Redfish-inprop vir BMC %s. Sy waardes kom uit die inpropkas; die gasheernaam is 'n gereserveerde naam wat nooit gekontak word nie."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti het geweier om die toestel te skep. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Die nuwe toestel sou deur jou toesteltoestemmings vir jou versteek gewees het, dus is dit weer verwyder. Vra 'n administrateur om toegang te verleen, of koppel die BMC aan 'n toestel wat jy kan sien."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "Die BMC is intussen deur iemand anders aan 'n toestel gekoppel, of kon nie gekoppel word nie, dus is die nuwe toestel weer verwyder. Herlaai die bladsy en gaan sy koppeling na."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Die Redfish-sjablone kon nie geïnstalleer word nie: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Die Redfish-sjablone is nie geïnstalleer of nie op datum nie. Herinstalleer dit vanaf die Redfish-BMC's-bladsy."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: sy Cacti-toestel is geskrap. Koppel dit aan 'n ander toestel of skep een vanaf die BMC's-bladsy."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: sy toestel word deur poller %d gepeil, maar die BMC word deur poller %d gelees. Skuif een van hulle sodat albei dieselfde poller gebruik, anders kan sy grafieke as onbekend lees."

