msgid "Redfish Admin"
msgstr "Redfish-admin"

#: lib/Pages.php
msgid "Redfish Health"
msgstr "Redfish-gesondheid"

#: lib/Settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Default %d, from %d to %d."
msgstr "%s Verstek %d, van %d tot %d."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Aanmeldbewyskluis"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Kluissleutellêer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Absolute pad na die 32-greep-sleutel wat gestoorde BMC-wagwoorde enkripteer. Skep dit self, buite die webwortel, slegs leesbaar deur die webbediener en poller-gebruiker, in 'n gids waartoe slegs root en daardie gebruiker kan skryf; die inprop skep of skryf dit nooit nie. Rugsteun dit saam met die databasis: daarsonder moet gestoorde wagwoorde weer ingevoer word."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Insamelaar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Insamelingsinterval"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Sekondes tussen lesings van elke BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Herontdekkingsinterval"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Sekondes tussen volle hulpbronontdekkings van elke BMC. 'n BMC word ook dadelik herontdek wanneer 'n bekende hulpbron verdwyn of van tipe verander."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Insamelaar-tydbegroting"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een versamelaarlopie mag bestee voordat dit ophou om nuwe BMC's te begin. Hou dit onder die poller-interval; onvoltooide BMC's hervat met die volgende lopie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMC's wat parallel gelees word. Elke BMC word deur een werker op 'n slag gelees."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Versamelaarwerkers"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Verbindingstydlimiet"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Sekondes toegelaat vir die TCP-verbinding en TLS-handdruk na 'n BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Versoektydlimiet"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Sekondes toegelaat vir een hele versoek aan 'n BMC, insluitend die verbinding."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB aanvaar in een BMC-antwoordliggaam; 'n groter antwoord word geweier."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Maksimum antwoordgrootte"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Varsheid"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Versamelingsintervalle waarna 'n lesing as vertraag gewys word."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Vertraag ná"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Versamelingsintervalle waarna 'n lesing verouderd is en as onbekend lees. Altyd minstens een meer as Vertraag ná."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Verouderd na"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Wanneer dit gemerk is, behou die verwydering van die inprop sy BMC-register, geënkripteerde wagwoorde en lesingskas. Maak dit leeg sodat die verwydering dit skrap. Verwydering raak nooit aan Cacti-toestelle, grafieke of BMC's nie, insluitend toestelle wat die inprop geskep het."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Verifieer teen die stelsel-CA-stoor"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Verifieer teen 'n CA-bundellêer"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Gespelde publieke sleutel (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Moenie verifieer nie (onveilig)"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "You do not have access to the Cacti device of this BMC."
msgstr "Jy het nie toegang tot die Cacti-toestel van hierdie BMC nie."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC could not be saved."
msgstr "Die BMC kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC was saved."
msgstr "Die BMC is gestoor."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Die BMC en sy gekaste data is geskrap. Sy Cacti-toestel is in plek gelaat."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Terugval en teruggehoude mislukkings is skoongemaak; die versamelaar lees die BMC met sy volgende lopie."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Die byvoeging van toestelle en grafieke vereis Cacti se toestelbestuur-toestemming."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Die toestel van hierdie BMC is geskrap. Kies eers 'n ander toestel, of geen, op die BMC-vorm."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data queries were indexed again and %d graphs were added."
msgstr "Die datanavrae is weer geïndekseer en %d grafieke is bygevoeg."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "Die toestel is geskep met sy Redfish-grafieke."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Installing the Redfish templates needs Cacti's Import Templates permission."
msgstr "Die installering van die Redfish-sjablone vereis Cacti se Voer sjablone in-toestemming."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are installed."
msgstr "Die Redfish-sjablone is geïnstalleer."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed. The health page shows why."
msgstr "Die Redfish-sjablone kon nie geïnstalleer word nie. Die gesondheidsbladsy wys hoekom."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The import could not be saved; nothing was imported."
msgstr "Die invoer kon nie gestoor word nie; niks is ingevoer nie."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs were imported."
msgstr "%d BMC's is ingevoer."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "This credential is used by a BMC on a Cacti device you do not have access to, so it cannot be changed here."
msgstr "Hierdie geloofsbrief word gebruik deur 'n BMC op 'n Cacti-toestel waartoe jy nie toegang het nie, dus kan dit nie hier verander word nie."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Name: another credential already uses this name."
msgstr "Naam: 'n ander geloofsbrief gebruik reeds hierdie naam."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "User Name: enter 1 to 255 characters without control characters."
msgstr "Gebruikersnaam: voer 1 tot 255 karakters sonder beheerkarakters in."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Password: enter the password of the BMC account."
msgstr "Wagwoord: voer die wagwoord van die BMC-rekening in."

#: redfish_credentials.php
#, php-format
msgid "The credential was saved, but the password was not stored: %s"
msgstr "Die geloofsbrief is gestoor, maar die wagwoord is nie gestoor nie: %s"

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential could not be saved."
msgstr "Die geloofsbrief kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was saved."
msgstr "Die geloofsbrief is gestoor."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential and its stored password were deleted."
msgstr "Die geloofsbrief en sy gestoorde wagwoord is geskrap."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was not deleted. A credential in use by a BMC cannot be deleted."
msgstr "Die geloofsbrief is nie geskrap nie. 'n Geloofsbrief wat deur 'n BMC gebruik word, kan nie geskrap word nie."

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Retry collection"
msgstr "Probeer versameling weer"

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Moniteringsaansig"

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Waarnemings kon nie gelees word nie. Vra 'n administrateur om die inproplogboek na te gaan."

